# visualizer/ wraps Jared Rhodenizer's ai-visualizer engine (server.py,
# core.js, index.html, assets/) verbatim - that project is AGPL-3.0 and
# this repo has no LICENSE of its own, so keeping it local-only avoids
# a real licensing question rather than quietly ignoring one in a public
# portfolio repo. bus.py (this project's own small module) stays tracked.
